# FMU shared libraries and the ONNX Runtime they load are build outputs shipped
# inside the Python package (src/surrogate_fmu/fmu/artifacts). Route them through
# Git LFS so the repository history stays small.
#
# Requires Git LFS on the server (verified: the LFS endpoint answers 401, not
# 404) and `git lfs install` on the client. Files must be re-added after this
# rule is in place; `git lfs migrate` is only needed for already-committed blobs.
*.dll   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.so    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.dylib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
